Monkeys heed stern order covering earth like locusts --- Rāma waits with Lakṣmaṇa at Prasravaṇa for month --- Śatabali heads north Vinata east Hanumān south Suṣēṇa west --- Sugrīva rejoices having spurred captains all ways --- Captains hasten roaring rushing to their directions --- Monkeys vow fetching Sītā slaying Rāvaṇa in battle --- Champions boast leaping hundred yōjanas churning oceans --- Champions claim unblocked course through earth sea Pātāla
